# Photoshop-compatible RGB->RGB device-link ICC skeleton. The structure
# comes from a working Color Lookup layer generated by 3D LUT Creator.
# The CLUT payload is NOT stored here. v0.3.4 patches the mAB grid size
# and offsets so the profile uses the residual LUT's native grid directly
# (normally 17^3) instead of resampling it to 40^3.
